### C.jet_secp_gej_affine_arithmetic.exec_affine_arithmetic
exec_affine_arithmetic
     : forall (le : Maps.PTree.tree Values.val) (m : Memory.Mem.mem) (bp b2 b3 : Values.block)
         (x y zi : forall _ : nat, Integers.Int64.int)
